                    39th Meeting, July 10, 1946, and was discussed by the Council during its 40th
                    Meeting, July 11, 1946; see the United States Delegation Records of the meetings
                    under reference, <ref target="#pg877">pp. 877</ref> and <ref target="#pg880"
                        >880</ref>.</p>
            </note>
